      "title": "Uncontrolled Resource Consumption in com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind",
      "description": "com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind versions >= 2.13.0 before 2.13.1, >= 2.10.0 before 2.12.6 are vulnerable to Denial of Service, but only when using JDK serialization to serialize / deserialize JsonNode values. If an attacker can provide their own input to the deserialization process, they can make the program run out of heap memory.",
